            "review_title": "Review at Japanese Dining Bar IROHA",
            "review_text": "Per H\nCopenhagen, Denmark791 contributions\n0\nOrdinary Sushi at elevated prices\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nThere are many Japanese restaurants in this city almost too many, this one won’t make it unless they sharpen up.\nFood is ok but very small size and therefore too expensive. Waiters friendly but nowhere to be seen and they kind of forget about you.\nWhy don’t they ask if I want another beer, more food…..\nI suggest that you take your business elsewhere.\nRead more\nWritten February 13, 2024",
